    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b35684b4cd9a44e30c2a4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们来到了一家店，里面陈列着\n福岛传统的漆器和陶瓷器——\n绘着漂亮花纹的工艺品琳琅满目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72400ec7a7afaf5777901b9a793d3d82547a7ba3c3aad763e1eecc95e13bde9",
